                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-blue-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Visit beforehand:</strong> Some facilities offer "tours"
                    to see the machine</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-blue-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Bring support:</strong> A friend or family member for
                    reassurance</span
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- During the Scan -->
            <div
              class="bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-white rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200"
            >
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
                💭 During Your Scan
              </h3>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-green-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Close your eyes:</strong> Can't see the tunnel if eyes
                    are shut</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-green-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Deep breathing:</strong> 4 counts in, 4 counts hold,
                    4 counts out</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-green-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Mental distraction:</strong> Plan your day, sing songs
