                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-green-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Focus on sounds:</strong> Count the knocking patterns</span
                  >
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <span class="text-green-600">•</span>
                  <span
                    ><strong>Remember the button:</strong> You can stop anytime</span
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white my-8"
